{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cc-demo-collection",
    "name": "Contact Centre — Demo",
    "description": "End-to-end API exerciser for the demo stack. Folders are organised by RBAC role so you can verify every gate. Pair with the `Contact Centre — Demo` environment.\n\nFlow that wires variables together:\n1. **Health** > anything (no auth needed)\n2. **Identity** > Whoami (Ada) — confirms agent bearer works\n3. **Tickets (Ada)** > List — auto-fills `{{ticket_id}}` and `{{conversation_id}}`\n4. **Tickets (Ada)** > Append message — sends a reply on the saved ticket\n5. **Supervisor (Bob)** / **Analytics (Bob)** — read-only dashboards\n6. **DSR (Diana)** > Open — auto-fills `{{dsr_id}}`; then Get / Assign / Resolve\n7. **Onboarding (Carol)** > Get tenant / Update retention / Invite agent\n8. **Negative — RBAC denies** — Ada hits an admin endpoint, expects 403\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health & probes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /healthz",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/healthz",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["healthz"]
            },
            "description": "Liveness probe. Returns 200 `ok` once the gateway is up. No auth."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /readyz",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/readyz",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["readyz"]
            },
            "description": "Readiness — only returns 200 when Postgres pings back."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /metrics",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/metrics",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["metrics"]
            },
            "description": "Prometheus exposition. Useful to confirm scrapes are reaching the gateway."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
